# the argument of aquinas-first-way.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
logic	s5kd
atom	argument_motion(x)	x: is the argument from motion
atom	certain_evident_sen	it is certain and evident to our senses that in the world some things are in motion
atom	now_motion_put(x)	x: Now is in motion is put in motion by another for nothing can be in motion except it is in potentiality to that towards which it is in motion whereas a thing moves inasmuch as it is in act
atom	motion_else_reduction	for motion is nothing else than the reduction of something from potentiality to actuality
atom	reduc_potentiality_actuality(x)	x: but can be reduced from potentiality to actuality except by something in a state of actuality
atom	actually_hot_fire	that which is actually hot as fire makes wood which is potentially hot to be actually hot and thereby moves and changes it
atom	now_possible_same	Now it is possible that the same thing should be at once in actuality and potentiality in the same respect but only in different respects
atom	actually_hot_simultaneously	for what is actually hot can simultaneously be potentially hot
atom	simultaneously_potentially_cold	it is simultaneously potentially cold
atom	impossible	it is impossible
atom	same_respect_same(x)	x: that in the same respect in the same way be both mover i.e. that it should move itself
atom	thing(x)	x: thing
atom	mov	moved
atom	motion_put_motion(x)	x: is in motion be put in motion by another
atom	put_motion_put	if that by which it is put in motion be itself put in motion then this also must needs be put in motion by another and that by another again
atom	see_subsequent_mover(x)	x: then there would be seeing that subsequent movers move only inasmuch as they are put in motion by the first mover
atom	first_mover_other(x)	x: first mover and consequently no other mover
atom	put_motion_hand	it is put in motion by the hand
atom	mov_2(x)	x: moves
atom	go_infinity	but this can go on to infinity
atom	necessary_arrive_first	it is necessary to arrive at a first mover put in motion by no other
atom	understand_god(x)	x: understands to be God
P1	S1	argument_motion(first_manifest_way)
P2	S2	certain_evident_sen
P3	S3	(all x: now_motion_put(x))
P4	S4	motion_else_reduction
P5	S5	(all x: !reduc_potentiality_actuality(x))
P6	S6	actually_hot_fire
P7	S7	!now_possible_same
P8	S8	!actually_hot_simultaneously
P9	S8	simultaneously_potentially_cold
P10	S9	impossible
P11	S9	((all x: thing(x) -> ought same_respect_same(x)) & mov)
P12	S10	(all x: []motion_put_motion(x))
P13	S11	put_motion_put
P14	S12	(all x: first_mover_other(x) -> !see_subsequent_mover(x))
P15	S12	((all x: first_mover_other(x) -> !see_subsequent_mover(x)) -> ((put_motion_hand & (put_motion_hand -> mov_2(staff)) & mov_2(staff)) & ((put_motion_hand & (put_motion_hand -> mov_2(staff)) & mov_2(staff)) -> !go_infinity) & !go_infinity))
P16	S12	((put_motion_hand & (put_motion_hand -> mov_2(staff)) & mov_2(staff)) & ((put_motion_hand & (put_motion_hand -> mov_2(staff)) & mov_2(staff)) -> !go_infinity) & !go_infinity)
P17	S13	necessary_arrive_first
C	S13	(all x: understand_god(x))
# rules tool=phil/skeleton date=2026-10-20
